        "detailed_description": "<h1>Contact</h1><p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Discord: </p></p><br><h1>About the Game</h1><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Story</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >I was once merely a composer, commissioned by the royal court to score the &quot;tale&quot; of the Snow Queen. Yet this manuscript appears to exist in multiple iterations. Some versions echo through city streets, while others lie buried beneath forest loam. She claims it to be her autobiography. The magic mirror, however, insists these are merely the chapters she wishes you to remember. I compose melodies. I unravel mysteries.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Key Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Distinctive Visual Aesthetic - A unique art style blending pixel art with fantasy elements, crafting an atmospheric dark fairy tale world</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Ensemble Narrative Design - Multiple interconnected storylines woven together through diverse, compelling characters with distinct personalities</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Immersive Musical Gameplay - Dynamic music game sequences that heighten narrative tension and deliver emotional crescendos</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Original Soundtrack - Meticulously composed music tailored specifically for the game experience</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Interactive Fiction Elements</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3907100/extras/53e8402a4ba62d6b0ed8c755432d9e51.poster.avif?t=1758110497\" width=1600 height=864 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3907100/extras/53e8402a4ba62d6b0ed8c755432d9e51.webm?t=1758110497\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3907100/extras/53e8402a4ba62d6b0ed8c755432d9e51.mp4?t=1758110497\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Scene-based interactive puzzles</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3907100/extras/771bf2465a8621dce5b127699d277526.poster.avif?t=1758110497\" width=1600 height=864 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3907100/extras/771bf2465a8621dce5b127699d277526.webm?t=1758110497\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3907100/extras/771bf2465a8621dce5b127699d277526.mp4?t=1758110497\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Use the mirror to uncover the truth</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3907100/extras/ea155409d8b34125daaae0261b78cdbf.poster.avif?t=1758110497\" width=1600 height=864 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3907100/extras/ea155409d8b34125daaae0261b78cdbf.webm?t=1758110497\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3907100/extras/ea155409d8b34125daaae0261b78cdbf.mp4?t=1758110497\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Rhythm Game Integration </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3907100/extras/f997a6fcf50e4846bde19ffc4fd45549.poster.avif?t=1758110497\" width=1600 height=864 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3907100/extras/f997a6fcf50e4846bde19ffc4fd45549.webm?t=1758110497\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3907100/extras/f997a6fcf50e4846bde19ffc4fd45549.mp4?t=1758110497\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Development Team</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>huxx</strong> - Game Design &amp; Programming<br><i>&quot;Dual-discipline developer specializing in design and technical implementation&quot;</i></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>沐风沐</strong> - Game Design<br><i>&quot;Wielding the mystical ability to challenge programmers and stress artists to their creative limits&quot;</i></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>骷髅男</strong> - Game Design &amp; Art<br><i>&quot;Visual artist pushing creative boundaries&quot;</i></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>楚狈良</strong> - Game Design &amp; Art<br><i>&quot;Design-focused artist bridging creative vision and visual execution&quot;</i></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >S.W.Diversity Studio (Music Team)</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Developer's Note</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Thank you for your interest in <strong>Empty Throne</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Empty Throne Studio represents an independent development collective comprised of university students who have dedicated their passion and spare time to game creation. Through perseverance and shared vision, we have brought our inaugural project to fruition.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Empty Throne</strong> marks our debut formal release. While we acknowledge areas for improvement, this project embodies our complete creative dedication and technical commitment. We take pride in presenting our first fully-realized interactive experience.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This journey represents both an ambitious creative undertaking and a collaborative adventure shared between developers and players. We invite you to explore this world we've crafted and hope <strong>Empty Throne</strong> delivers a memorable, atmospheric, and emotionally resonant gaming experience.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Thank you for joining us on this narrative adventure.</strong></p>",
        "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Story</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >I was once merely a composer, commissioned by the royal court to score the &quot;tale&quot; of the Snow Queen. Yet this manuscript appears to exist in multiple iterations. Some versions echo through city streets, while others lie buried beneath forest loam. She claims it to be her autobiography. The magic mirror, however, insists these are merely the chapters she wishes you to remember. I compose melodies. I unravel mysteries.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Key Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Distinctive Visual Aesthetic - A unique art style blending pixel art with fantasy elements, crafting an atmospheric dark fairy tale world</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Ensemble Narrative Design - Multiple interconnected storylines woven together through diverse, compelling characters with distinct personalities</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Immersive Musical Gameplay - Dynamic music game sequences that heighten narrative tension and deliver emotional crescendos</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Original Soundtrack - Meticulously composed music tailored specifically for the game experience</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Interactive Fiction Elements</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3907100/extras/53e8402a4ba62d6b0ed8c755432d9e51.poster.avif?t=1758110497\" width=1600 height=864 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3907100/extras/53e8402a4ba62d6b0ed8c755432d9e51.webm?t=1758110497\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3907100/extras/53e8402a4ba62d6b0ed8c755432d9e51.mp4?t=1758110497\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Scene-based interactive puzzles</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3907100/extras/771bf2465a8621dce5b127699d277526.poster.avif?t=1758110497\" width=1600 height=864 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3907100/extras/771bf2465a8621dce5b127699d277526.webm?t=1758110497\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3907100/extras/771bf2465a8621dce5b127699d277526.mp4?t=1758110497\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Use the mirror to uncover the truth</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3907100/extras/ea155409d8b34125daaae0261b78cdbf.poster.avif?t=1758110497\" width=1600 height=864 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3907100/extras/ea155409d8b34125daaae0261b78cdbf.webm?t=1758110497\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3907100/extras/ea155409d8b34125daaae0261b78cdbf.mp4?t=1758110497\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Rhythm Game Integration </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3907100/extras/f997a6fcf50e4846bde19ffc4fd45549.poster.avif?t=1758110497\" width=1600 height=864 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3907100/extras/f997a6fcf50e4846bde19ffc4fd45549.webm?t=1758110497\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3907100/extras/f997a6fcf50e4846bde19ffc4fd45549.mp4?t=1758110497\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Development Team</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>huxx</strong> - Game Design &amp; Programming<br><i>&quot;Dual-discipline developer specializing in design and technical implementation&quot;</i></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>沐风沐</strong> - Game Design<br><i>&quot;Wielding the mystical ability to challenge programmers and stress artists to their creative limits&quot;</i></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>骷髅男</strong> - Game Design &amp; Art<br><i>&quot;Visual artist pushing creative boundaries&quot;</i></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>楚狈良</strong> - Game Design &amp; Art<br><i>&quot;Design-focused artist bridging creative vision and visual execution&quot;</i></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >S.W.Diversity Studio (Music Team)</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Developer's Note</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Thank you for your interest in <strong>Empty Throne</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Empty Throne Studio represents an independent development collective comprised of university students who have dedicated their passion and spare time to game creation. Through perseverance and shared vision, we have brought our inaugural project to fruition.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Empty Throne</strong> marks our debut formal release. While we acknowledge areas for improvement, this project embodies our complete creative dedication and technical commitment. We take pride in presenting our first fully-realized interactive experience.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This journey represents both an ambitious creative undertaking and a collaborative adventure shared between developers and players. We invite you to explore this world we've crafted and hope <strong>Empty Throne</strong> delivers a memorable, atmospheric, and emotionally resonant gaming experience.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Thank you for joining us on this narrative adventure.</strong></p>",
